        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Greatest Hits Volume 1, Rubber Soul, Revolver, A Collection of Beatles Oldies, Sgt. Pepper's Lonely Hearts Club Band\n- Companies: EMI Australia\n- Topics: album compilation gaps in Beatles discography\n\nFacts:\n- EMI Australia compiled Greatest Hits Volume 1 to fill the gap between Rubber Soul and Revolver.\n- In 1966, A Collection of Beatles Oldies served a similar gap-filling role between Revolver and Sgt. Pepper's Lonely Hearts Club Band.\n- A Collection of Beatles Oldies was subtitled But Goldies!",
